    ${Y}dev${N} [cmd]        ⚠  your own code — Claude login + full internet + your Mac's Claude history
    exec [cmd]       open another terminal into the running sandbox

    ${B}flags${N} ${DIM}(run / dev)${N}
      --ephemeral    tmpfs home — logins & caches destroyed on exit.
                     ${DIM}use this for deploy sessions (vercel/heroku/netlify login)${N}
