    Each ${B}project${N} gets its own proxy and isolated network.
    Each ${B}client${N} gets its own /home/node volume — caches and Claude history
    persist per client and never leak across them.
    Client is resolved from: ${C}\$AIRLOCK_CLIENT${N} → ${C}.airlock-client${N} file → parent dir name.

    reset [client]   wipe a client's home volume (default: this project's client)

